From fab6611d610b2f75fd1edfb5fa0e4627471e27cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: git ref fetch: fetch shallow review stacks

Expose depth and shallow-exclusion controls on `jj git ref fetch`. Fetch
through the excluded base and deepen one more generation so the oldest
review commit has a usable diff parent, while refreshing the index on
every boundary change

